### run 1
=== descriptors, matching and FAST ===
 752x480, FAST threshold 40, 256-bit descriptors, OpenCV at 1 thread

 detections: binCV 4144, cv::FAST 4144 (1.1% of pixels)

 arm                                        ns/frame    vs OpenCV
 FAST binCV                                3024214.1        0.96x
 FAST cv::FAST                             2909563.5             
 describe binCV BRIEF                       663355.9       11.00x
 describe cv::ORB (does more)              7297824.3             
 match kNN=2 binCV                        19442185.0        1.96x
 match kNN=2 cv::BFMatcher                38161241.5             

 1000 keypoints described and matched.
 cv::ORB::compute ALSO computes orientation and rotates its pattern per
 keypoint, so that row is not a like-for-like comparison and is not a
 claim. FAST and matching are.

